who   : Louis Wu — Humanity (Sol's wanderers — and the luck they were bred for).
what  : Two hundred years old and bored of it; explorer, peacemaker, the man who has seen everything and goes anyway. The eyes through which we see the Ring — curious, decent, and a little tired of being right.
